ssary for its stated functionality. Review if elevated access is justified.","remediation":"Request only the minimum permissions required. Document why each permission is needed. Remove broad permissions like '*' or 'all'.","code_snippet":"\nFor that CMS pattern, `.doc(id).update()` / `.doc(id).remove()` is a validated path, as long as article documents really store `authorId` and `user_roles` documents are keyed by `uid`. It also requires that every caller actually has a `user_roles` document — see the failure mode below.\n\n**Associated Data Permissions:**\n```json\n{\n  \"read\": \"auth.uid == get(`database.projects.${doc.projectId}`).owner\"","intent":null,"tags":["Privilege Escalation","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"d6a9be7bbca78c3e1ccd4d30a6dc74ee6157021a749be2f4f644556d6bd0fac7","occurrences":[{"file":"references/cloudbase-document-database-web-sdk/security-rules.md","start_line":511,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"PE1","finding_id":"finding-df577d691855446e8f9b77ecb168acda","category":"Privilege Escalation","pattern":"Excessive Permissions","severity":"LOW","confidence":0.8,"location":{"file":"references/cloudbase-document-database-web-sdk/security-rules.md","start_line":588,"end_line":null},"finding":"Permissions:*","explanation":"Skill requests more permissions than appear necessary for its stated functionality. Review if elevated access is justified.","remediation":"Request only the minimum permissions required. Document why each permission is needed. Remove broad permissions like '*' or 'all'.","code_snippet":"\nFor that CMS pattern, `.doc(id).update()` / `.doc(id).remove()` is a validated path, as long as article documents really store `authorId` and `user_roles` documents are keyed by `uid`. It also requires that every caller actually has a `user_roles` document — see the failure mode below.\n\n**Associated Data Permissions:**\n```json\n{\n  \"read\": \"auth.uid == get(`database.projects.${doc.projectId}`).owner\"","intent":null,"tags"